OL,3,GNEWSABrain cancer campaigners praise
OL,4,Agovernment meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family campaigning for increased
OL,7,Finvestment in brain cancer research
OL,8,Fafter the death of their teenage son
OL,9,Fhave said their meeting with a
OL,10,Fgovernment official "could not have
OL,11,Fgone better".
OL,13,FMax Hall, 14, from Corby, was diagnosed
OL,14,Fwith an incurable brain tumour last
OL,15,Fyear - and died in August.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
