OL,3,GNEWSABrain cancer campaigners praise
OL,4,Agovernment meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family met James Frith, the health
OL,7,Fminister for rare diseases, at
OL,8,FWestminster on Wednesday, to discuss
OL,9,Fcommitments on annual funding for
OL,10,Fresearch as well as targets to ensure
OL,11,Frare tumours received the same
OL,12,Fattention as other cancers.
OL,14,FMax's mother Jackie said Frith "made
OL,15,Fcommitments" to take the family's
OL,16,Fquestions forward.
